#23027 (claim 6123839199, amended on the card at this stamp) carries its remaining half into `packages/runtime` on PR #23045:
- `loadArtifactBundle` (`packages/runtime/src/load-artifact-bundle.ts`) runs `applyArtifactForwardConversions` once on the loaded bundle, before `mergeRuntimeModule` and every runtime reader, so an option-B artifact built before a retirement boots at `os dev -a` and `os start`;
- one door test beside it;
- one comment sentence in `app-plugin.ts` (the `servicePayload` note that package bodies are what "no conversion reaches").

At this stamp, PR #23046 (#22989) edits `app-plugin.ts` in the config door's `api` items, a different region, and the later lander merges `main`. PR #23003 and PR #22962 are disjoint. If a card of this lane will edit `loadArtifactBundle` or `mergeRuntimeModule`, say so here.

